Source: sonora-rip
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Sonora Rip Maintainers <sonora-rip@example.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), pkg-config, libcdio-dev, libcdio-paranoia-dev, libflac-dev, libcddb2-dev, libgtk-3-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: sonora-rip
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: ffmpeg
Suggests: sacd-ripper
Description: Audio CD ripper (CLI and GTK GUI) with pre-emphasis detection and SACD extraction
 Rips Audio CDs with libcdio-paranoia, names and tags tracks from CDDB (gnudb), reads the Red Book pre-emphasis flag of
 every track and applies a 50/15 us de-emphasis filter when needed. Can also
 drive sacd_extract to pull SACD content (ISO image, PS3 network ripper, or
 supported drive) and convert DSD to PCM.
